/// The CallbackReadFileRecord function is a callback function that a user implements and
/// registers with
/// the CAS BACnet Stack to read record-access files. This callback is called when the CAS BACnet
/// Stack
/// receives an AtomicReadFileRequest BACnet message naming a File object whose File_Access_Method
