/// * `fileStartRecord` - The zero-based record number to start writing at.
/// * `recordCount` - The number of records supplied.
/// * `recordData` - The record payloads, back to back.
/// * `recordDataLengths` - The octet length of each supplied record.
/// * `ackFileStartRecord` - The record number where the write actually began.
/// * `errorCode` - Parameter to store an error during the callback. Errors supported: if the
///   fileStartRecord is out of range: INVALID_FILE_START_POSITION, if the file is full:
///   FILE_FULL.
