/// BACnetStack_AddObjectPropertyReferenceToChannel, writable in place by a client
/// WriteProperty, and used by the stack to fan a WriteGroup out to the referenced properties)
/// - ExecutionDelay (#967: also maintained by BACnetStack_AddObjectPropertyReferenceToChannel,
/// appended in lockstep with each reference so it can never disagree in length with
/// ListOfObjectPropertyReferences - see that function's doc. A client WriteProperty replaces the
/// whole array and is rejected if the new length does not match ListOfObjectPropertyReferences.)
///
