///   order. NULL is rejected.
/// * `ipAddressLength` - (in) Pass exactly 6. Not enforced - see the trap above.
/// * `subnetMask` - (in) 4 bytes. NULL is rejected.
/// * `subnetMaskLength` - (in) Pass exactly 4. Not enforced - see the trap above.
///
/// # Returns
///
