/// * `flags` - (in) See the flags table above (bit 0 = use objectInstance).
/// * `objectInstance` - (in) The object instance to create at, if flags bit 0 is set; otherwise ignored.
/// * `connectionString` - (in) The datalink address to send TO (the destination) - not the local address to send
///   from. For IPv4 this is 6 bytes: 4 octets of IPv4 address followed by 2 octets of port,
